Follow-Up Tradeoff Questions

Kafka vs Event Hub

Kafka:

* More control

Event Hub:

* Managed service

⸻

Batch vs Streaming

Batch:

* Cheap

Streaming:

* Low latency

⸻

Delta vs Parquet

Parquet:

* Storage only

Delta:

* ACID + Time Travel + Merge

⸻

Star vs Snowflake

Star:

* Faster BI

Snowflake:

* Less redundancy

