Final Interview Closing Answer

Whenever they ask:

“Why did you choose this architecture?”

Use this framework:

1. Scalability
2. Reliability
3. Security
4. Cost
5. Maintainability

Example:

“I chose Kafka + Delta Lake because it provides scalable ingestion, reliable processing through ACID transactions, secure governance via Unity Catalog, lower operational cost through optimized storage, and easier maintenance through medallion architecture.”
